9fae0c84e389a6bb8a70a87566d","owner":"landofsky","created":1753554920000,"modified":1754343927000,"guid":null,"name":"LOSRC_Schools_Latest_(Public_View)_","title":"LOSRC Schools Latest (Public View) ","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":"<p><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(74,74,74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>Locations of schools across the LOSRC's FBRMPO and LOSRPO regions were collected and assimilated from local governments, the NC Department of Instruction's <\/span><\/span><a style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 97, 155); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration:none; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;' target='_blank' href='https://www.nconemap.gov/datasets/nconemap::public-schools/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Public Schools <\/a><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(74,74,74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>and <\/span><\/span><a style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 97, 155); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration:none; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;' target='_blank' href='https://www.nconemap.gov/datasets/ncdoa::nc-non-public-schools-latest-version/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Non-Public Schools<\/a><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(74,74,74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'> datasets, and previous project-specific data from the LOSRC. Each of the locations and attributes of these data were validated and verified using a combination of sources (i.e. school websites, local government parcels, local government addresses, Google Maps, Esri basemap imagery, <\/span><\/span><a style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 97, 155); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration:none; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;' target='_blank' href='https://www.nconemap.gov/datasets/nconemap::latest-orthoimagery/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>NC OneMap Imagery<\/a><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(74,74,74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><span style='display:inline !important; float:none; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>) and further characterized by type (i.e. public or privately funded) and sub-type (i.e. detailed type of school base on curriculum, the school's management type, and other factors). School website links are included within the data as well.<\/span><\/span><\/p>","tags":["Transportation","Transportation Planning","Transportation Safety","Public Input","K-12 Schools","Student Safety","French Broad River MPO","Land of Sky RPO","Land of Sky Regional Council","Madison County","Buncombe County","Henderson County","Haywood County","Transylvania County","Safe Routes to Schools"],"snippet":"Locations of all education facilities across the the Land of Sky Regional Council's (LOSRC) French Broad River Metropolitan Planning Organization (FBRMPO) and Land of Sky Rural Planning Organization (LOSRPO) regions (i.e. Madison, Buncombe, Henderson, Haywood, and Transylvania counties). Data last updated: 7/25/2025.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1753560062103.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-83.13779349302182,35.10152543562913],[-82.1730292369385,35.98052363801138]],"categories":["/Categories/Content Status/Final Public"],"spatialReference":"102719","accessInformation":"LOSRC, FBRMPO, LOSRPO","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"<p>The spatial data provided here are not intended for legal, engineering, or surveying use. The Land of Sky Regional Council (LOSRC), French Broad River Metropolita